    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40584" root="نمط" body-key="n">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَنْمِيطٌ</span></b>  signifies The <i>directing,</i> or <i>guiding,</i>
to a thing. (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْ نَمَّطَكَ عَلَى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هٰذَا الشَّىْءِ</span> <i>Who directed thee,</i> or <i>guided thee,
to this thing?</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَلَّكَ عَلَيْهِ</span>. (Ibn-'Abbád.)

